pt DNS resolver cache and resets network socket catalogue."}, "46": {"Title": "Enable TCP FastOpen", "Tip": "Halves connection establishment latency for modern web and game servers."}, "47": {"Title": "Enable TCP ECN & Receive Side Scaling (RSS)", "Tip": "Prevents packet congestion and splits network traffic across multi-core CPUs."}, "48": {"Title": "Disable TCP Timestamps Overhead", "Tip": "Removes unnecessary 12-byte timestamp headers from TCP packets."}, "49": {"Title": "Disable Nagle's Algorithm (TCPNoDelay)", "Tip": "Forces instant transmission of small packets, eliminating game ping delay."}, "50": {"Title": "Lock TcpAckFrequency to 1", "Tip": "Sends immediate ACK responses for every packet to prevent ping spikes."}, "51": {"Title": "Expand MaxUserPort to 65534", "Tip": "Maximizes concurrent socket capacity for multiplayer games."}, "52": {"Title": "Reduce TcpTimedWaitDelay to 30s", "Tip": "Releases closed network connections 4x faster from memory."}, "53": {"Title": "Disable Delivery Optimization P2P Uploads", "Tip": "Prevents Windows Update from using your bandwidth to upload updates to strangers."}, "54": {"Title": "Disable NIC Power Management Sleep", "Tip": "Stops Wi-Fi / Ethernet chips from entering low-power sleep states in games."}, "55": {"Title": "Lower Wi-Fi Roaming Aggressiveness", "Tip": "Prevents Wi-Fi adapter from constantly searching for alternate APs and dropping packets."}, "56": {"Title": "Run Live Ping & Jitter Latency Test", "Tip": "Measures real-time round-trip latency and stability to Cloudflare servers."}, "57": {"Title": "Test for Network Packet Loss", "Tip": "Tests active connection for lost or dropped packets."}, "58": {"Title": "Block Telemetry IPs in Hosts File", "Tip": "Redirects 100+ Microsoft tracking domains to 0.0.0.0 via hosts file."}, "59": {"Title": "Restore Default Clean Hosts File", "Tip": "Cleans and resets the Windows hosts file back to factory defaults."}, "60": {"Title": "Enable DNS Leak Protection", "Tip": "Forces Windows to use exclusively specified DNS servers across all interfaces."}, "61": {"Title": "Uninstall 50+ Safe UWP Bloatware Apps", "Tip": "Uninstalls pre-installed Microsoft junk apps (BingNews, Weather, Clipchamp, Zune, etc.)."}, "62": {"Title": "Disable Windows Copilot AI Systemwide", "Tip": "Shuts down Windows Copilot AI background agents and policies."}, "63": {"Title": "Disable Start Menu Bing Cloud Search", "Tip": "Restores fast local-only search without sending keystrokes to Bing."}, "64": {"Title": "Disable Microsoft DiagTrack Telemetry", "Tip": "Stops Connected User Experiences and Telemetry background service."}, "65": {"Title": "Disable Activity History & Timeline", "Tip": "Stops Windows from tracking and recording user activity history."}, "66": {"Title": "Disable Edge Startup Boost & Background Mode", "Tip": "Prevents Microsoft Edge from running resident background instances when closed."}, "67": {"Title": "Disable Advertising ID Tracking", "Tip": "Blocks targeted advertising identifiers across all Windows apps."}, "68": {"Title": "Block Background App Location Access", "Tip": "Prevents background apps from silently polling GPS/Wi-Fi location."}, "69": {"Title": "Disable CEIP Customer Experience Tasks", "Tip": "Disables scheduled telemetry data upload tasks."}, "70": {"Title": "Disable Microsoft Compatibility Appraiser", "Tip": "Stops daily background scan that consumes excessive CPU cycles."}, "71": {"Title": "Disable Disk Diagnostic Data Collector", "Tip": "Stops background telemetry tracking of disk read/write logs."}, "72": {"Title": "Disable Universal Background App Permissions", "Tip": "Prevents Store apps from draining RAM and CPU while minimized."}, "73": {"Title": "Disable Lockscreen Ads & Consumer Tips", "Tip": "Removes promoted ads, trivia, and suggested apps from lockscreen."}, "74": {"Title": "Disable Crash Report Prompt Popups", "Tip": "Silently terminates crashed programs without freezing the desktop."}, "75": {"Title": "Disable ETW Autol