ws Güncellemelerini Tekrar Aç ve Devam Ettir", "Tip": "Windows Update servisini tekrar otomatik haline getirir."}, "149": {"Title": "Hemen Güvenli Sistem Geri Yükleme Noktası Oluştur", "Tip": "Ayarlara başlamadan önce tek tıkla güvenli bir Windows Geri Yükleme Noktası alır."}, "150": {"Title": "TÜM AYARLARI SIFIRLA (Windows Fabrika Varsayılanı)", "Tip": "Uygulanan tüm optimizasyonları standart Windows fabrika ayarlarına döndürür."}}, "de": {"1": {"Title": "CPU Core Unpark & Power Plan Lock", "Tip": "Prevents CPU cores from sleeping during games, locking full sustained clock speeds."}, "2": {"Title": "Game Booster Turbo Mode", "Tip": "Closes heavy background browsers, Discord, Spotify and releases RAM before gaming."}, "3": {"Title": "RAM & Standby Cache Purge", "Tip": "Triggers the Windows Garbage Collector to flush idle memory and working sets."}, "4": {"Title": "Universal GPU Shader Cache Purge", "Tip": "Cleans bloated DirectX, NVIDIA DXCache, AMD DxCache and Intel shader caches."}, "5": {"Title": "Enable HAGS (Hardware GPU Scheduling)", "Tip": "Hands GPU scheduling directly to graphics hardware processor, boosting FPS."}, "6": {"Title": "Lock DirectX MaxFrameLatency=1", "Tip": "Caps pre-rendered frame queue to 1 to eliminate rendering input lag."}, "7": {"Title": "Force Fullscreen Optimizations (FSE)", "Tip": "Eliminates DWM borderless composition lag, unlocking true exclusive fullscreen speeds."}, "8": {"Title": "Disable Game DVR Background Recording", "Tip": "Stops Windows from recording video clips in the background to prevent frame drops."}, "9": {"Title": "Lighten DWM Transparency & Blur", "Tip": "Reduces Desktop Window Manager GPU compositor load during gaming."}, "10": {"Title": "Set GDI Process Handle Quota to 65536", "Tip": "Expands UI object limits to prevent crashes in heavily modded games."}, "11": {"Title": "Disable Power Throttling", "Tip": "Stops Windows from artificially throttling CPU wattage during background tasks."}, "12": {"Title": "Disable Fast Startup Memory Leak", "Tip": "Prevents Windows kernel session leaks and stale memory locking across reboots."}, "13": {"Title": "Set Win32PrioritySeparation to 38", "Tip": "Grants foreground games 3x prioritized CPU time slices compared to background apps."}, "14": {"Title": "Set MMCSS Games GPU Priority to 8", "Tip": "Locks Multimedia Class Scheduler Service GPU priority to High for stutter-free audio/video."}, "15": {"Title": "Get Competitive CS2 / Esports Launch Options", "Tip": "Outputs esports-grade launch parameters (-high, -threads, +fps_max 0)."}, "16": {"Title": "Disable HPET (High Precision Event Timer)", "Tip": "Disables legacy platform timer clock to minimize DPC latency."}, "17": {"Title": "Disable Dynamic Tick Clock Interrupts", "Tip": "Stops erratic timer interrupt variations on laptop processors, curing micro-stutters."}, "18": {"Title": "Enable DirectPlay Legacy Gaming Support", "Tip": "Enables DirectPlay required by classic titles (GTA SA, NFS, Age of Empires)."}, "19": {"Title": "Install .NET Framework 3.5 / 2.0", "Tip": "Installs foundational runtimes needed by older modded game launchers."}, "20": {"Title": "Get Minecraft Java Aikar's GC Flags", "Tip": "Provides battle-tested Java Garbage Collection arguments for lag-free Minecraft."}, "21": {"Title": "Hardware SSD Re-TRIM Force", "Tip": "Sends hardware TRIM commands to refresh flash blocks and restore factory write speeds."}, "22": {"Title": "Clean Windows & User Temp Folders", "Tip": "Wipes junk temporary files across AppData and Windows root temp."}, "23": {"Title": "DISM WinSxS Component Store ResetBase", "Tip": "Cleans superseded Windows Update backup binaries to free up gigabytes."}, "24": {"Title": "Clean Windows Update Download Cache", "Tip": "Deletes cached installer files inside SoftwareDistribution\\Download."}, "25": {"Title": "Purge Chrome, Brave & Edge Browser Cache", "Tip": "Wipes cached web assets from all Chromium-based browsers."}, "26": {"Title": "Purge Developer (npm, pip, yarn) Caches", "Tip": "Purges gigabytes of forgotten local npm and pip download packages."}, "27": {"Title": "Purge Crash Dumps (.dmp) & Minidumps", "Tip": "Removes legacy BSOD memory dump files from the disk."}, "28": {"Title": "Force Empty Recycle Bin on All Drives", "Tip": "Instantly empties Recycle Bins across C:, D: and all connected volumes."}, "29": {"Title": "Disable NTFS 8.3 Short Name Creation", "Tip": "Disables 16-bit MS-DOS file naming overhead to accelerate SSD directory lookups."}, "30": {"Title": "Disable NTFS Last Access Timestamp", "Tip": "Stops Windows from writing access timestamps every time a file is read."}, "31": {"Title": "Set NTFS MftZone Area to 2", "Tip": "Expands Master File Table allocation space to prevent file system fragmentation."}, "32": {"Title": "Clear Thumbnail Cache (thumbcache_*.db)", "Tip": "Flushes corrupted or oversized thumbnail preview databases."}, "33": {"Title": "Reset IconCache (IconCache.db)", "Tip": "Fixes broken or invisible desktop and taskbar icons."}, "34": {"Title": "Reset Windows FontCache Service", "Tip": "Clears corrupt font caches to accelerate system boot time."}, "35": {"Title": "Clean Discord & Telegram Chat Caches", "Tip": "Frees disk space consumed by cached chat images and videos."}, "36": {"Title": "Clear Delivery Optimization Cache", "Tip": "Deletes residual Windows Update peer-to-peer distribution packages."}, "37": {"Title": "Clear Stale Windows Event Logs", "Tip": "Clears bloated Application and System event log entries."}, "38": {"Title": "Perform Free Space TRIM Pass", "Tip": "Trims unused free disk space sectors on SSDs."}, "39": {"Title": "Delete Massive MEMORY.DMP Dumps", "Tip": "Deletes gigabyte-sized kernel memory crash dumps."}, "40": {"Title": "Analyze Downloads Folder Disk Usage", "Tip": "Reports total disk space consumed by files in your Downloads directory."}, "41": {"Title": "Switch to Cloudflare 1.1.1.1 DNS", "Tip": "Applies the world's fastest and lowest-latency gaming DNS to all active adapters."}, "42": {"Title": "Switch to Google 8.8.8.8 DNS", "Tip": "Sets reliable, high-uptime Google DNS servers."}, "43": {"Title": "Switch to Quad9 9.9.9.9 Security DNS", "Tip": "Sets privacy-centric Quad9 DNS with automated malware blocking."}, "44": {"Title": "Reset DNS to Automatic (DHCP)", "Tip": "Restores ISP / Router default DNS configuration."}, "45": {"Title": "Flush DNS Cache & Reset Winsock", "Tip": "Clears corrupt DNS resolver cache and resets network socket catalogue."}, "46": {"Title": "Enable TCP FastOpen", "Tip": "Halves connection establishment latency for modern web and game servers."}, "47": {"Title": "Enable TCP ECN & Receive Side Scaling (RSS)", "Tip": "Prevents packet congestion and splits network traffic across multi-core CPUs."}, "48": {"Title": "Disable TCP Timestamps Overhead", "Tip": "Removes unnecessary 12-byte timestamp headers from TCP packets."}, "49": {"Title": "Disable Nagle's Algorithm (TCPNoDelay)", "Tip": "Forces instant transmission of small packets, eliminating game ping delay."}, "50": {"Title": "Lock TcpAckFrequency to 1", "Tip": "Sends immediate ACK responses for every packet to prevent ping spikes."}, "51": {"Title": "Expand MaxUserPort to 65534", "Tip": "Maximizes concurrent socket capacity for multiplayer games."}, "52": {"Title": "Reduce TcpTimedWaitDelay to 30s", "Tip": "Releases closed network connections 4x faster from memory."}, "53": {"Title": "Disable Delivery Optimization P2P Uploads", "Tip": "Prevents Windows Update from using your bandwidth to upload updates to strangers."}, "54": {"Title": "Disable NIC Power Management Sleep", "Tip": "Stops Wi-Fi / Ethernet chips from entering low-power sleep states in games."}, "55": {"Title": "Lower Wi-Fi Roaming Aggressiveness", "Tip": "Prevents Wi-Fi adapter from constantly searching for alternate APs and dropping packets."}, "56": {"Title": "Run Live Ping & Jitter Latency Test", "Tip": "Measures real-time round-trip latency and stability to Cloudflare servers."}, 