me Creation", "Tip": "Disables 16-bit MS-DOS file naming overhead to accelerate SSD directory lookups."}, "30": {"Title": "Disable NTFS Last Access Timestamp", "Tip": "Stops Windows from writing access timestamps every time a file is read."}, "31": {"Title": "Set NTFS MftZone Area to 2", "Tip": "Expands Master File Table allocation space to prevent file system fragmentation."}, "32": {"Title": "Clear Thumbnail Cache (thumbcache_*.db)", "Tip": "Flushes corrupted or oversized thumbnail preview databases."}, "33": {"Title": "Reset IconCache (IconCache.db)", "Tip": "Fixes broken or invisible desktop and taskbar icons."}, "34": {"Title": "Reset Windows FontCache Service", "Tip": "Clears corrupt font caches to accelerate system boot time."}, "35": {"Title": "Clean Discord & Telegram Chat Caches", "Tip": "Frees disk space consumed by cached chat images and videos."}, "36": {"Title": "Clear Delivery Optimization Cache", "Tip": "Deletes residual Windows Update peer-to-peer distribution packages."}, "37": {"Title": "Clear Stale Windows Event Logs", "Tip": "Clears bloated Application and System event log entries."}, "38": {"Title": "Perform Free Space TRIM Pass", "Tip": "Trims unused free disk space sectors on SSDs."}, "39": {"Title": "Delete Massive MEMORY.DMP Dumps", "Tip": "Deletes gigabyte-sized kernel memory crash dumps."}, "40": {"Title": "Analyze Downloads Folder Disk Usage", "Tip": "Reports total disk space consumed by files in your Downloads directory."}, "41": {"Title": "Switch to Cloudflare 1.1.1.1 DNS", "Tip": "Applies the world's fastest and lowest-latency gaming DNS to all active adapters."}, "42": {"Title": "Switch to Google 8.8.8.8 DNS", "Tip": "Sets reliable, high-uptime Google DNS servers."}, "43": {"Title": "Switch to Quad9 9.9.9.9 Security DNS", "Tip": "Sets privacy-centric Quad9 DNS with automated malware blocking."}, "44": {"Title": "Reset DNS to Automatic (DHCP)", "Tip": "Restores ISP / Router default DNS configuration."}, "45": {"Title": "Flush DNS Cach