nent Store ResetBase", "Tip": "Cleans superseded Windows Update backup binaries to free up gigabytes."}, "24": {"Title": "Clean Windows Update Download Cache", "Tip": "Deletes cached installer files inside SoftwareDistribution\\Download."}, "25": {"Title": "Purge Chrome, Brave & Edge Browser Cache", "Tip": "Wipes cached web assets from all Chromium-based browsers."}, "26": {"Title": "Purge Developer (npm, pip, yarn) Caches", "Tip": "Purges gigabytes of forgotten local npm and pip download packages."}, "27": {"Title": "Purge Crash Dumps (.dmp) & Minidumps", "Tip": "Removes legacy BSOD memory dump files from the disk."}, "28": {"Title": "Force Empty Recycle Bin on All Drives", "Tip": "Instantly empties Recycle Bins across C:, D: and all connected volumes."}, "29": {"Title": "Disable NTFS 8.3 Short Name Creation", "Tip": "Disables 16-bit MS-DOS file naming overhead to accelerate SSD directory lookups."}, "30": {"Title": "Disable NTFS Last Access Timestamp", "Tip": "Stops Windows from writing access timestamps every time a file is read."}, "31": {"Title": "Set NTFS MftZone Area to 2", "Tip": "Expands Master File Table allocation space to prevent file system fragmentation."}, "32": {"Title": "Clear Thumbnail Cache (thumbcache_*.db)", "Tip": "Flushes corrupted or oversized thumbnail preview databases."}, "33": {"Title": "Reset IconCache (IconCache.db)", "Tip": "Fixes broken or invisible desktop and taskbar icons."}, "34": {"Title": "Reset Windows FontCache Service", "Tip": "Clears corrupt font caches to accelerate system boot time."}, "35": {"Title": "Clean Discord & Telegram Chat Caches", "Tip": "Frees disk space consumed by cached chat images and videos."}, "36": {"Title": "Clear Delivery Optimization Cache", "Tip": "Deletes residual Windows Update peer-to-peer distribution packages."}, "37": {"Title": "Clear Stale Windows Event Logs", "Tip": "Clears bloated Application and System event log entries."}, "38": {"Title": "Perform Free Space TRIM Pass", "Tip": "Trims unused