loper (npm, pip, yarn) Caches", "Tip": "Purges gigabytes of forgotten local npm and pip download packages."}, "27": {"Title": "Purge Crash Dumps (.dmp) & Minidumps", "Tip": "Removes legacy BSOD memory dump files from the disk."}, "28": {"Title": "Force Empty Recycle Bin on All Drives", "Tip": "Instantly empties Recycle Bins across C:, D: and all connected volumes."}, "29": {"Title": "Disable NTFS 8.3 Short Name Creation", "Tip": "Disables 16-bit MS-DOS file naming overhead to accelerate SSD directory lookups."}, "30": {"Title": "Disable NTFS Last Access Timestamp", "Tip": "Stops Windows from writing access timestamps every time a file is read."}, "31": {"Title": "Set NTFS MftZone Area to 2", "Tip": "Expands Master File Table allocation space to prevent file system fragmentation."}, "32": {"Title": "Clear Thumbnail Cache (thumbcache_*.db)", "Tip": "Flushes corrupted or oversized thumbnail preview databases."}, "33": {"Title": "Reset IconCache (IconCache.db)", "Tip": "Fixes broken or invisible desktop and taskbar icons."}, "34": {"Title": "Reset Windows FontCache Service", "Tip": "Clears corrupt font caches to accelerate system boot time."}, "35": {"Title": "Clean Discord & Telegram Chat Caches", "Tip": "Frees disk space consumed by cached chat images and videos."}, "36": {"Title": "Clear Delivery Optimization Cache", "Tip": "Deletes residual Windows Update peer-to-peer distribution packages."}, "37": {"Title": "Clear Stale Windows Event Logs", "Tip": "Clears bloated Application and System event log entries."}, "38": {"Title": "Perform Free Space TRIM Pass", "Tip": "Trims unused free disk space sectors on SSDs."}, "39": {"Title": "Delete Massive MEMORY.DMP Dumps", "Tip": "Deletes gigabyte-sized kernel memory crash dumps."}, "40": {"Title": "Analyze Downloads Folder Disk Usage", "Tip": "Reports total disk space consumed by files in your Downloads directory."}, "41": {"Title": "Switch to Cloudflare 1.1.1.1 DNS", "Tip": "Applies the world's fastest and lowest-latency gaming DNS to all active adapters."}, "42": {"Title": "Switch to Google 8.8.8.8 DNS", "Tip": "Sets reliable, high-uptime Google DNS servers."}, "43": {"Title": "Switch to Quad9 9.9.9.9 Security DNS", "Tip": "Sets privacy-centric Quad9 DNS with automated malware blocking."}, "44": {"Title": "Reset DNS to Automatic (DHCP)", "Tip": "Restores ISP / Router default DNS configuration."}, "45": {"Title": "Flush DNS Cache & Reset Winsock", "Tip": "Clears corrupt DNS resolver cache and resets network socket catalogue."}, "46": {"Title": "Enable TCP FastOpen", "Tip": "Halves connection establishment latency for modern web and game servers."}, "47": {"Title": "Enable TCP ECN & Receive Side Scaling (RSS)", "Tip": "Prevents packet congestion and splits network traffic across multi-core CPUs."}, "48": {"Title": "Disable TCP Timestamps Overhead", "Tip": "Removes unnecessary 12-byte timestamp headers from TCP packets."}, "49": {"Title": "Disable Nagle's Algorithm (TCPNoDelay)", "Tip": "Forces instant transmission of small packets, eliminating game ping delay."}, "50": {"Title": "Lock TcpAckFrequency to 1", "Tip": "Sends immediate ACK responses for every packet to prevent ping spikes."}, "51": {"Title": "Expand MaxUserPort to 65534", "Tip": "Maximizes concurrent socket capacity for multiplayer games."}, "52": {"Title": "Reduce TcpTimedWaitDelay to 30s", "Tip": "Releases closed network connections 4x faster from memory."}, "53": {"Title": "Disable Delivery Optimization P2P Uploads", "Tip": "Prevents Windows Update from using your bandwidth to upload updates to strangers."}, "54": {"Title": "Disable NIC Power Management Sleep", "Tip": "Stops Wi-Fi / Ethernet chips from entering low-power sleep states in games."}, "55": {"Title": "Lower Wi-Fi Roaming Aggressiveness", "Tip": "Prevents Wi-Fi adapter from constantly searching for alternate APs and dropping packets."}, "56": {"Title": "Run Live Ping & Jitter Latency Test", "Tip": "Measures real-time round-trip latency and stability to Cloudflare servers."}, "57": {"Title": "Test for Network Packet Loss", "Tip": "Tests active connection for lost or dropped packets."}, "58": {"Title": "Block Telemetry IPs in Hosts File", "Tip": "Redirects 100+ Microsoft tracking domains to 0.0.0.0 via hosts file."}, "59": {"Title": "Restore Default Clean Hosts File", "Tip": "Cleans and resets the Windows hosts file back to factory defaults."}, "60": {"Title": "Enable DNS Leak Protection", "Tip": "Forces Windows to use exclusively specified DNS servers across all interfaces."}, "61": {"Title": "Uninstall 50+ Safe UWP Bloatware Apps", "Tip": "Uninstalls pre-installed Microsoft junk apps (BingNews, Weather, Clipchamp, Zune, etc.)."}, "62": {"Title": "Disable Windows Copilot AI Systemwide", "Tip": "Shuts down Windows Copilot AI background agents and policies."}, "63": {"Title": "Disable Start Menu Bing Cloud Search", "Tip": "Restores fast local-only search without sending keystrokes to Bing."}, "64": {"Title": "Disable Microsoft DiagTrack Telemetry", "Tip": "Stops Connected User Experiences and Telemetry background service."}, "65": {"Title": "Disable Activity History & Timeline", "Tip": "Stops Windows from tracking and recording user activity history."}, "66": {"Title": "Disable Edge Startup Boost & Background Mode", "Tip": "Prevents Microsoft Edge from running resident background instances when closed."}, "67": {"Title": "Disable Advertising ID Tracking", "Tip": "Blocks targeted advertising identifiers across all Windows apps."}, "68": {"Title": "Block Background App Location Access", "Tip": "Prevents background apps from silently polling GPS/Wi-Fi location."}, "69": {"Title": "Disable CEIP Customer Experience Tasks", "Tip": "Disables scheduled telemetry data upload tasks."}, "70": {"Title": "Disable Microsoft Compatibility Appraiser", "Tip": "Stops daily background scan that consumes excessive CPU cycles."}, "71": {"Title": "Disable Disk Diagnostic Data Collector", "Tip": "Stops background telemetry tracking of disk read/wr