FS 8.3 Short Name Creation", "Tip": "Disables 16-bit MS-DOS file naming overhead to accelerate SSD directory lookups."}, "30": {"Title": "Disable NTFS Last Access Timestamp", "Tip": "Stops Windows from writing access timestamps every time a file is read."}, "31": {"Title": "Set NTFS MftZone Area to 2", "Tip": "Expands Master File Table allocation space to prevent file system fragmentation."}, "32": {"Title": "Clear Thumbnail Cache (thumbcache_*.db)", "Tip": "Flushes corrupted or oversized thumbnail preview databases."}, "33": {"Title": "Reset IconCache (IconCache.db)", "Tip": "Fixes broken or invisible desktop and taskbar icons."}, "34": {"Title": "Reset Windows FontCache Service", "Tip": "Clears corrupt font caches to accelerate system boot time."}, "35": {"Title": "Clean Discord & Telegram Chat Caches", "Tip": "Frees disk space consumed by cached chat images and videos."}, "36": {"Title": "Clear Delivery Optimization Cache", "Tip": "Deletes residual Windows Update peer-to-peer distribution packages."}, "37": {"Title": "Clear Stale Windows Event Logs", "Tip": "Clears bloated Application and System event log entries."}, "38": {"Title": "Perform Free Space TRIM Pass", "Tip": "Trims unused free disk space sectors on SSDs."}, "39": {"Title": "Delete Massive MEMORY.DMP Dumps", "Tip": "Deletes gigabyte-sized kernel memory crash dumps."}, "40": {"Title": "Analyze Downloads Folder Disk Usage", "Tip": "Reports total disk space consumed by files in your Downloads directory."}, "41": {"Title": "Switch to Cloudflare 1.1.1.1 DNS", "Tip": "Applies the world's fastest and lowest-latency gaming DNS to all active adapters."}, "42": {"Title": "Switch to Google 8.8.8.8 DNS", "Tip": "Sets reliable, high-uptime Google DNS servers."}, "43": {"Title": "Switch to Quad9 9.9.9.9 Security DNS", "Tip": "Sets privacy-centric Quad9 DNS with automated malware blocking."}, "44": {"Title": "Reset DNS to Automatic (DHCP)", "Tip": "Restores ISP / Router default DNS configuration."}, "45": {"Title": "Flush DNS Cache & Reset Winsock", "Tip": "Clears corrupt DNS resolver cache and resets network socket catalogue."}, "46": {"Title": "Enable TCP FastOpen", "Tip": "Halves connection establishment latency for modern web and game servers."}, "47": {"Title": "Enable TCP ECN & Receive Side Scaling (RSS)", "Tip": "Prevents packet congestion and splits network traffic across multi-core CPUs."}, "48": {"Title": "Disable TCP Timestamps Overhead", "Tip": "Removes unnecessary 12-byte timestamp headers from TCP packets."}, "49": {"Title": "Disable Nagle's Algorithm (TCPNoDelay)", "Tip": "Forces instant transmission of small packets, eliminating game ping delay."}, "50": {"Title": "Lock TcpAckFrequency to 1", "Tip": "Sends immediate ACK responses for every packet to prevent ping spikes."}, "51": {"Title": "Expand MaxUserPort to 65534", "Tip": "Maximizes concurrent socket capacity for multiplayer games."}, "52": {"Title": "Reduce TcpTimedWaitDelay to 30s", "Tip": "Releases closed network connections 4x faster from memory."}, "53": {"Title": "Disable Delivery Optimization P2P Uploads", "Tip": "Prevents Windows Update from using your bandwidth to upload updates to strangers."}, "54": {"Title": "Disable NIC Power Management Sleep", "Tip": "Stops Wi-Fi / Ethernet chips from entering low-power sleep states in games."}, "55": {"Title": "Lower Wi-Fi Roaming Aggressiveness", "Tip": "Prevents Wi-Fi adapter from constantly searching for alternate APs and dropping packets."}, "56": {"Title": "Run Live Ping & Jitter Latency Test", "Tip": "Measures real-time round-trip latency and stability to Cloudflare servers."}, "57": {"Title": "Test for Network Packet Loss", "Tip": "Tests active connection for lost or dropped packets."}, "58": {"Title": "Block Telemetry IPs in Hosts File", "Tip": "Redirects 100+ Microsoft tracking domains to 0.0.0.0 via hosts file."}, "59": {"Title": "Restore Default Clean Hosts File", "Tip": "Cleans and resets the Windows hosts file back to factory defaults."}, "60": {"Title": "Enable DNS Leak Protection", "Tip": "Forces Windows to use exclusively specified DNS servers across all interfaces."}, "61": {"Title": "Uninstall 50+ Safe UWP Bloatware Apps", "Tip": "Uninstalls pre-installed Microsoft junk apps (BingNews, Weather, Clipchamp, Zune, etc.)."}, "62": {"Title": "Disable Windows Copilot AI Systemwide", "Tip": "Shuts down Windows Copilot AI background agents and policies."}, "63": {"Title": "Disable Start Menu Bing Cloud Search", "Tip": "Restores fast local-only search without sending keystrokes to Bing."}, "64": {"Title": "Disable Microsoft DiagTrack Telemetry", "Tip": "Stops Connected User Experiences and Telemetry background service."}, "65": {"Title": "Disable Activity History & Timeline", "Tip": "Stops Windows from tracking and recording user activity history."}, "66": {"Title": "Disable Edge Startup Boost & Background Mode", "Tip": "Prevents Microsoft Edge from running resident background instances when closed."}, "67": {"Title": "Disable Advertising ID Tracking", "Tip": "Blocks targeted advertising identifiers across all Windows apps."}, "68": {"Title": "Block Background App Location Access", "Tip": "Prevents background apps from silently polling GPS/Wi-Fi location."}, "69": {"Title": "Disable CEIP Customer Experience Tasks", "Tip": "Disables scheduled telemetry data upload tasks."}, "70": {"Title": "Disable Microsoft Compatibility Appraiser", "Tip": "Stops daily background scan that consumes excessive CPU cycles."}, "71": {"Title": "Disable Disk Diagnostic Data Collector", "Tip": "Stops background telemetry tracking of disk read/write logs."}, "72": {"Title": "Disable Universal Background App Permissions", "Tip": "Prevents Store apps from draining RAM and CPU while minimized."}, "73": {"Title": "Disable Lockscreen Ads & Consumer Tips", "Tip": "Removes promoted ads, trivia, and suggested apps from lockscreen."}, "74": {"Title": "Disable Crash Report Prompt Popups", "Tip": "Silently terminates crashed programs without freezing the desktop."}, "75": {"Title": "Disable ETW Autologgers Disk Traces", "Tip": "Stops 30 kernel trace loggers from constantly writing background disk logs."}, "76": {"Title": "Disable Windows 11 Recall AI Snapshots", "Tip": "Disables continuous screenshot indexing in Windows 11."}, "77": {"Title": "Hide Search Box Web Trends & Highlights", "Tip": "Removes celebrity news and web highlights from the Windows search bar."}, "78": {"Title": "Disable Microsoft Office Telemetry", "Tip": "Disables background usage logging in Microsoft Office suite."}, "79": {"Title": "Disable GPU Driver Telemetry Services", "Tip": "Stops NVIDIA / AMD telemetry containers from uploading telemetry."}, "80": {"Title": "Disable Windows Error Reporting (WerSvc)", "Tip": "Disables error reporting service to speed up system responsiveness."}, "81": {"Title": "Enable Classic Windows 10 Context Menu", "Tip": "Restores the fast, full right-click context menu without 'Show more options'."}, "82": {"Title": "Restore Modern Windows 11 Context Menu", "Tip": "Reverts right-click menu back to default Windows 11 design."}, "83": {"Title": "Disable Windows 11 Widgets (News) Panel", "Tip": "Removes the distracting news/weather widget button from the taskbar."}, "84": {"Title": "Open File Explorer to 'This PC'", "Tip": "Opens File Explorer directly to disk drives instead of Home/Quick Access."}, "85": {"Title": "Always Show Known File Extensions (.exe)", "Tip": "Makes file extensions visible to instantly spot disguised malware."}, "86": {"Title": "Toggle Show Hidden Files & Folders", "Tip": "Toggles visibility for AppData and hidden system directories."}, "87": {"Title": "Create 'GodMode' Folder on Desktop", "Tip": "Creates a single folder containing all 200+ Windows Control Panel tools."}, "88": {"Title": "Hide Gallery & 3D Objects from Explorer", "Tip": "Declutters the File Explorer left navigation pane."}, "89": {"Title": "Restore Classic Windows Photo Viewer", "Tip": "Enables the ultra-fast Windows 7 photo viewer executable."}, "90": {"Title": "Disable Mouse Acceleration (1:1 Raw Aim)", "Tip": "Enables true 1:1 hardware mouse tracking for esports FPS aiming."}, "91": {"Title": "Set Keyboard Input Delay to 0ms", "Tip": "Removes key repeat initial delay for instantaneous keyboard response."}, "92": {"Title": "Set Keyboard Repeat Speed to Max (31)", "Tip": "Maximizes key repeat rate for rapid input execution."}, "93": {"Title": "Set Mouse Data Queue Size to 100 Packets", "Tip": "Prevents mouse input buffer overflow during rapid flick movements."}, "94": {"Title": "Set Keyboard Data Queue Size to 100 Packets", "Tip": "Prevents keyboard buffer bottlenecking during rapid macro keystrokes."}, "95": {"Title": "Enable USB Port Low-Latency Mode", "Tip": "Disables successive inter-packet delays on USB root hubs."}, "96": {"Title": "Set MenuShowDelay to 0ms (Instant Menus)", "Tip": "Eliminates the 400ms pause when hovering over Windows menus."}, "97": {"Title": "Set HungAppTimeout to 1s (Fast Close)", "Tip": "Instantly closes frozen applications without locking up the OS."}, "98": {"Title": "Disable Window Minimize/Maximize Animations", "Tip": "Removes window transition animations for a snappy interface."}, "99": {"Title": "Disable Snap Assist Flyout Overlay", "Tip": "Prevents the window tiling suggestion menu from lagging dragging actions."}, "100": {"Title": "Disable Aero Shake Window Minimizing", "Tip": "Prevents shaking a window from accidentally minimizing other open windows."}, "101": {"Title": "Enable Windows Sandbox (Safe VM)", "Tip": "Enables a disposable, isolated Windows environment for testing suspicious files."}, "102": {"Title": "Enable WSL (Windows Subsystem for Linux)", "Tip": "Enables native Linux kernel environment within Windows."}, "103": {"Title": "Enable Hyper-V Virtualization Hypervisor", "Tip": "Enables hardware virtualization hypervisor for VMs and emulators."}, "104": {"Title": "Disable XPS Viewer & Document Writer", "Tip": "Removes obsolete XPS printing features to save system memory."}, "105": {"Title": "Remove Legacy Windows Media Player", "Tip": "Uninstalls obsolete WMP components."}, "106": {"Title": "Disable Vulnerable SMBv1 Protocol", "Tip": "Protects against ransomware exploits (like WannaCry) on local networks."}, "107": {"Title": "Disable Telnet & TFTP Clients", "Tip": "Disables unencrypted legacy remote communication protocols."}, "108": {"Title": "Disable Internet Explorer Engine Leftovers", "Tip": "Deactivates residual Internet Explorer components."}, "109": {"Title": "Add Steamapps to Defender Exclusions", "Tip": "Skips Defender scanning on Steam library folder to accelerate game loads."}, "110": {"Title": "Cap Defender Max CPU Usage to 25%", "Tip": "Prevents Windows Defender background scans from choking the CPU."}, "111": {"Title": "Set Taskbar Preview Delay to 10s", "Tip": "Prevents hover thumbnails from popping up and causing game focus loss."}, "112": {"Title": "Disable UAC Secure Desktop Dimming", "Tip": "Removes screen freezing delay when User Account Control prompts appear."}, "113": {"Title": "Restart Windows Explorer (explorer.exe)", "Tip": "Instantly restarts Windows Explorer to apply UI tweaks."}, "114": {"Title": "Restart Windows Audio Service (AudioSrv)", "Tip": "Fixes missing sound issues without rebooting."}, "115": {"Title": "List All Startup Programs", "Tip": "Lists applications configured to auto-start with Windows."}, "116": {"Title": "Clean Broken Startup Registry Entries", "Tip": "Removes orphaned startup entries left by deleted applications."}, "117": {"Title": "Disable Google & Adobe Background Updaters", "Tip": "Stops persistent updater services from running when apps are closed."}, "118": {"Title": "Reset Windows Firewall Rules to Default", "Tip": "Restores factory Windows Firewall configuration."}, "119": {"Title": "Manage Driver Signature Enforcement", "Tip": "Toggles driver signature verification for custom peripheral drivers."}, "120": {"Title": "Rebuild Windows Search Index", "Tip": "Rebuilds corrupt search database to fix broken file search."}, "121": {"Title": "Read Live GPU Temp, Power & VRAM", "Tip": "Queries real-time GPU thermals, power draw, and VRAM utilization."}, "122": {"Title": "Read Live CPU Clock Speed & Usage", "Tip": "Displays current processor frequency in MHz and core load."}, "123": {"Title": "Get SSD Health & SMART Status Report", "Tip": "Checks NVMe/SATA SSD operational status and drive health."}, "124": {"Title": "Generate Laptop Battery Health Report", "Tip": "Generates battery wear and cycle count analysis."}, "125": {"Title": "Find Top 15 Resource-Heavy Processes", "Tip": "Ranks top 15 memory and CPU consuming background tasks."}, "126": {"Title": "Read Recent BSOD & Crash Event Logs", "Tip": "Queries Windows Event Viewer for recent fatal error logs."}, "127": {"Title": "Export Complete Hardware Specs Summary", "Tip": "Outputs full specifications of CPU, GPU, Motherboard and RAM."}, "128": {"Title": "Query Available Free RAM & Memory Pool", "Tip": "Reports total visible RAM and available free physical memory."}, "129": {"Title": "Query C: Drive Free Capacity", "Tip": "Checks free storage space on system drive."}, "130": {"Title": "Verify Firewall Active Profile States", "Tip": "Verifies Domain, Private and Public firewall profiles."}, "131": {"Title": "Measure Last BIOS / UEFI Boot Time", "Tip": "Reports exact duration of system boot sequence."}, "132": {"Title": "Query Windows Activation & License State", "Tip": "Checks Windows license status and product key channels."}, "133": {"Title": "Run SFC /Scannow System File Repair", "Tip": "Scans and automatically repairs corrupt Windows system files."}, "134": {"Title": "Run DISM /RestoreHealth Image Repair", "Tip": "Repairs corrupted Windows Component Store from official Microsoft servers."}, "135": {"Title": "Run CHKDSK File System Integrity Scan", "Tip": "Scans C: drive for file system corruption and bad sectors."}, "136": {"Title": "Reset Microsoft Stor