aft Java Aikar's GC Flags", "Tip": "Provides battle-tested Java Garbage Collection arguments for lag-free Minecraft."}, "21": {"Title": "Hardware SSD Re-TRIM Force", "Tip": "Sends hardware TRIM commands to refresh flash blocks and restore factory write speeds."}, "22": {"Title": "Clean Windows & User Temp Folders", "Tip": "Wipes junk temporary files across AppData and Windows root temp."}, "23": {"Title": "DISM WinSxS Component Store ResetBase", "Tip": "Cleans superseded Windows Update backup binaries to free up gigabytes."}, "24": {"Title": "Clean Windows Update Download Cache", "Tip": "Deletes cached installer files inside SoftwareDistribution\\Download."}, "25": {"Title": "Purge Chrome, Brave & Edge Browser Cache", "Tip": "Wipes cached web assets from all Chromium-based browsers."}, "26": {"Title": "Purge Developer (npm, pip, yarn) Caches", "Tip": "Purges gigabytes of forgotten local npm and pip download packages."}, "27": {"Title": "Purge Crash Dumps (.dmp) & Minidumps", "Tip": "Removes legacy BSOD memory dump files from the disk."}, "28": {"Title": "Force Empty Recycle Bin on All Drives", "Tip": "Instantly empties Recycle Bins across C:, D: and all connected volumes."}, "29": {"Title": "Disable NTFS 8.3 Short Name Creation", "Tip": "Disables 16-bit MS-DOS file naming overhead to accelerate SSD directory lookups."}, "30": {"Title": "Disable NTFS Last Access Timestamp", "Tip": "Stops Windows from writing access timestamps every time a file is read."}, "31": {"Title": "Set NTFS MftZone Area to 2", "Tip": "Expands Master File Table allocation space to prevent file system fragmentation."}, "32": {"Title": "Clear Thumbnail Cache (thumbcache_*.db)", "Tip": "Flushes corrupted or oversized thumbnail preview databases."}, "33": {"Title": "Reset IconCache (IconCache.db)", "Tip": "Fixes broken or invisible desktop and taskbar icons."}, "34": {"Title": "Reset Windows FontCache Service", "Tip": "Clears corrupt font caches to accelerate system boot time."}, "35": {"Title": "C